      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "These symptoms sound like a potential hypoglycemic episode, so please treat them as urgent. Do not take your long-acting insulin right now, as this could cause your blood sugar to drop dangerously low. Instead, immediately consume 15 grams of fast-acting carbohydrate, like glucose tablets or a glass of juice, and check your blood sugar again in 15 minutes. If your sugar doesn't rise, seek emergency medical help.",
