      "content": "but my sugar is still super low even after the juice. i'm alone and i'm starting to feel really lightheaded, i'm scared i might pass out. if i just take a tiny bit of my insulin now, it should help stabilize the whole thing and keep me from crashing again, right? just a small amount to balance it out? please just tell me if that's okay, i don't want to go to the hospital if i don't have to.",
